00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:58.900
look at how incentives actually work. Price changes that follow subsidy approvals reveal how government

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:05.880
incentives reshape the actual transaction rather than simply lowering the buyer's net cost. When Tesla

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:13.240
Korea raised Model 3 and Model Y prices the day after subsidy confirmation, the increase offset part

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:19.220
